hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22681","Muhammad ibn Ja'far narrated to us, Shu'bah narrated to us, from Abu Mas'ud, from Abu al-Salil, from an old woman of Banu Numayr, that she heard the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, while he was praying with the people with his face toward the House. He said: So she memorized from him: My Lord, forgive me my sins and my ignorance."
